thub.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":5,"created_at":"2026-07-21T16:31:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-31T17:53:18Z","closed_at":"2026-07-31T17:53:18Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.1-stable (Windows - x86_32), 4.7-stable (Windows - x86_32)\n- Not reproducible in: 4.7.1-stable (Windows - x86_64), 4.7-stable (Windows - x86_64)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.1.stable - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - AMD Ryzen 7 4800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads) - 3.87 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nImporting a `.blend` file with `-col` or `-convcol` suffixes (and likely other) in object names results in a crash when it's added to a scene or an inherited scene is created. This has been observed in x86_32 builds for Windows; 64-bit counterparts are OK. Other suffixes and platforms have not been tested.\n\n```\n================================================================\nCrashHandlerException: Program crashed with signal 11\nEngine version: Godot Engine v4.7.1.stable.official (a13da4feb8d8aefc283c3763d33a2f170a18d541)\nDumping the backtrace. Please include this when reporting the bug on: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues\nLoad address: 50000\n\n[1] 4899177 (main+4449177) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n[2] 760216d1 (kernelbase.dll+1e16d1) - no debug info in PE/COFF executable\n-- END OF C++ BACKTRACE --\n================================================================\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Import a `.blend` with at least 1 suffix in an object's name, for example: `Cube-col`\n2. Drag the `.blend` into a scene or create an inherited scene - the editor should crash.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThis 4.7.1-stable project already contains `default_cube_with_collision.blend` for your convenience, simply add it to a scene or create an inherited scene. To edit the `.blend` file you will need the latest `5.2` version of Blender.\n\n[gd_project_win_32_blend_import_crash.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30235861/gd_project_win_32_blend_import_crash.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121608/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121608/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}